  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Schrift X — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can create cursed seals that allow for permeation and your eyes are also cursed with a seal due to this technique.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you have a cursed mark somewhere on your body that molds your cursed energy automatically. When you make a ranged weapon attack, you can choose to use your Cursed Energy modifier for the attack or damage rolls. When you make a ranged attack, you can spend 1 ce to ignore cover by phasing through a solid object. You can only pierce through 5 feet of one object. This increases to two objects at 3rd, three at 6th, and four at 11th.</p>",
